    "cinematic": {
      "style": "comica",
      "lines": [
        "Kiko, el mapache mensajero, llega tarde a su entrega más importante.",
        "¡La ciudad está llena de vagones, vallas y conos traviesos!",
        "Salta, desliza y recoge monedas: ¡no hay tiempo que perder!"
      ],
      "direction": {
        "approach": "character_focus",
        "rationale": "Carril Cometa es un runner 2D de vista trasera con tono cómico. La intro funciona mejor centrada en Kiko, visto de espaldas, con cortes enérgicos tipo caricatura. Primero se muestra la prisa del personaje, luego los obstáculos traviesos que asoman al fondo y por último el arranque hacia el gameplay. Así la cámara coincide con la vista final del juego (jugador abajo, carriles convergiendo al horizo",
        "mood": "Cheerful, frantic and slapstick: warm late-afternoon coastal sunlight, candy colors, comic timing with squash-and-stretch and quick punch-ins.",
        "notes": "Idle: Kiko starts in a panicked jog-in-place (arms swinging, striped tail wagging, backpack bouncing) at the bottom-center of lane 2. Obstacles (cones, low fences, train cars) stay static with a gentle wobble and each gets a comic 'pop-in' scale bounce when the camera passes it. Keep the three-lane road, vanishing point and parallax buildings, fences, billboards and palm trees in the same layout as gameplay so no scene swap is needed. Handoff: in the final shot, ease the camera to the gameplay f",
        "shots": [
          {
            "lineIndex": 0,
            "durationSec": 4.2,
            "staging": "Start with a tight rear close-up of Kiko's backpack and striped tail as he checks an oversized wristwatch with a comic double-take (a squash-and-stretch jump). The camera pulls back and up to reveal the full 3-lane road converging to a sunset horizon. Kiko then bursts into a run ",
            "camera": {
              "from": [
                0,
                -60,
                2.2
              ],
              "to": [
                0,
                0,
                1
              ],
              "lookAt": [
                0,
                40,
                0
              ],
              "fov": 50,
              "ease": "easeOut"
            },
            "fx": [
              "sweat_drop_pop",
              "watch_shake",
              "speed_lines_soft",
              "parallax_slow",
              "sun_glow_warm"
            ]
          },
          {
            "lineIndex": 1,
            "durationSec": 4.5,
            "staging": "Quick comic tour of the dangers: the camera pans up the road from Kiko to the horizon and punches in on each obstacle in turn. A cone wobbles, a low fence tilts with a squeak, and a big train car slides into a lane with a cartoon honk. Each obstacle gets a small scale-bounce as t",
            "camera": {
              "from": [
                0,
                -20,
                1
              ],
              "to": [
                0,
                70,
                1.4
              ],
              "lookAt": [
                0,
                90,
                0
              ],
              "fov": 42,
              "ease": "smooth"
            },
            "fx": [
              "obstacle_pop_bounce",
              "cartoon_honk_puff",
              "dust_puff_small",
              "parallax_medium",
              "gulp_sweat_drop"
            ]
          },
          {
            "lineIndex": -1,
            "durationSec": 2.4,
            "staging": "Bridge gag: a row of coins appears in an arc over the middle lane, each with a sparkle. Kiko's eyes turn to coin shapes and the camera does a quick whip-zoom toward the arc. A magnet and a shield icon flash briefly in the sky as a power-up teaser.",
            "camera": {
              "from": [
                0,
                10,
                1.2
              ],
              "to": [
                0,
                35,
                0.9
              ],
              "lookAt": [
                0,
